  "world": "\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 B SILENT \u2014 of 90 rounds whose code references a judge, only 9 (10.0%) record one in their artifact, and 7 record two. \u2b50 SO A READER CANNOT TELL A ONE-JUDGE VERDICT FROM A TWO-JUDGE ONE WITHOUT OPENING THE CODE, and the deliverable inherits exactly that ambiguity \u2014 R683 showed the \u2462 separation resolves at 2B and not at 0.8B, so the judge is not a detail, it is the scope. \u26a0 AND THE CONFOUND IS WHY THIS NUMBER IS SMALL AND NOT ZERO: 270 rounds mention no judge anywhere and are EXCLUDED rather than counted as unrecorded \u2014 absence of a judge key is not evidence of one judge, and folding those in would have manufactured a far worse-looking gap.",
